@startuml
title Vehicle Evidence Content Map

salt
{
  {T
  + Source category | Typical input meaning | Processing focus | Vehicle Evidence result | Key metadata
  ++ Runtime metrics | numeric value and source unit | unit conversion and range validation | normalized metric with unit | source, time, correlation
  ++ Hardware metrics | measurement or resource status | range and availability validation | resource metric or operational state | source, time, quality
  ++ S-CORE module states | module state or health enum | state mapping and unknown handling | normalized module state | source, time, correlation
  ++ Events and faults | event/fault code and severity | code lookup and original-value preservation | typed event or fault evidence | source, time, quality
  ++ Execution context | workload, execution, and resource identifiers | identity and correlation validation | evidence identity and context | source, time, correlation
  }
  --
  {T
  + Cross-cutting output | Meaning
  ++ Quality information | validity, freshness, completeness, and mapping quality
  ++ Collection status | VEL Health for the collection and processing pipeline
  ++ Publication | normalized Vehicle Evidence through the configured output interface
  }
}
@enduml
